SASL mechanism longer than the message: error response
password without a terminator: error response
password message at the Int32 maximum: error response
password message above the limit: error response
SASL initial response at the Int32 maximum: error response
SASL final response at the Int32 maximum: error response
well-formed exchange: query result received
query with a smuggled tail: error response
query shorter than declared: error response
oversized sync: error response
